{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24378","headline":"宅西有流水墙下构小楼临玩之时颇有幽趣因命歌酒聊以自娱独醉独吟偶题五绝句 一 · 白居易","name":"宅西有流水墙下构小楼临玩之时颇有幽趣因命歌酒聊以自娱独醉独吟偶题五绝句 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊水分来不自由，无人解爱爲谁流。\n家家抛向墙根底，唯我栽莲越小楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}